    ["Entangling Roots Visual Only."] = "Entangling Roots Visual Only.",
    ["Giant Insect Swarm Visual Only."] = "Giant Insect Swarm Visual Only.",
    ["Inflicts weapon damage plus $s1 to an enemy and its nearest ally and knocks them back."] =
